OL,3,GNEWSADisruption warning ahead of
OL,4,Afive-day rail closure
OL,5,
OL,6,FPassengers have been warned to expect
OL,7,Fdisruption to their journeys ahead of a
OL,8,Fplanned rail closure.
OL,10,FNetwork Rail will carry out five days
OL,11,Fof railway upgrades between Worcester
OL,12,Fand Hereford from Monday.
OL,14,FServices will be disrupted until Friday
OL,15,F31, with rail replacement buses
OL,16,Foperating on affected sections of the
OL,17,Froute.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,356,350,200,160,0,100
