OL,3,GNEWSADisruption warning ahead of
OL,4,Afive-day rail closure
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We know there is never a good time to
OL,7,Fclose the railway, so we're making the
OL,8,Fmost of these five days to complete a
OL,9,Fwide range of essential improvements,"
OL,10,Fsaid Adam Checkley, engineering
OL,11,Fdirector for Network Rail's Central
OL,12,Froute.
